{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FROM ANGEL TURNED SHE-DEVIL AND CAST DOWN TO HELL HOW WILL YOU SURVIVE?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cFor reasons unknown to her, former Divine Angel, Hesicasial has been sent to hell with amnesia. All she can remember is her name, and now she must learn to survive her new horrifying prison.\u00a0 She must defend herself using Physical Combat and Devil Magick against a variety of Demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge, Mine, Hunt, Craft and Build until you have an epic home or many.\u00a0 Craft for your survival and overpower your enemies. Become the most formidable She-Devil in all of Hell.\u00a0 Let your curiosity take hold as you explore mysterious ruins.\u00a0 Take the fight to the other Devils and Raid their Fortresses to show them who is boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No matter what adventures you have by day, just remember to keep safe by night... for this is Hell!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore \u2013</strong> \u00a0Experience Hell like you never have before in a massive and unique open world environment. \u00a0Navigate through the wastelands of lava lakes and harsh flora &amp; fauna. \u00a0Encounter a variety of demonic beings to fight. \u00a0Discover minerals to mine, Demonic Ruins and Devil Fortresses to explore loot and knock down for resources. \u00a0And watch out for noxious plants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mine \u2013</strong> Find and Mine a variety of minerals to help you craft and forge equipment and building materials.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft \u2013</strong> Make a variety of weapons, armour and tools.\u00a0 Craft blocks to build buildings and make crafting stations, storage containers, furniture and more whether it be for usefulness or aesthetics, you decide.<br><br><br><strong>Blacksmithing \u2013</strong> Take Crafting to the next level with Blacksmithing.\u00a0 Sculpt Stone moulds on workbench, Smelt Ore into them and then Forge them on an Anvil. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build \u2013</strong> Let your imagination run wild with the flexibility of the voxel block building mechanic, you can build any kind of building design, like playing with Lego!\u00a0 Create you building blocks out of a variety of materials and craft various shapes to help give it that unique look. Use a hammer to rotate different shaped blocks into any direction you please. \u00a0\u00a0Craft and place Furniture, Crafting Stations and Storage containers and more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enchanting \u2013</strong> Find and Mine Magical Blue Flint, bring them to Sacrificial Circles, Choose any Tool, Weapon or Piece of Armour to Enhance and then slay an enemy in the Pentagram and receive your item back Enchanted!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Improve \u2013</strong> Begin the game naked and vulnerable and progress to an Epically Equipped She-Devil not to be trifled with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combat \u2013</strong> Encounter a variety of Demons and Devils and engage in intense melee hack and slash combat or use magic for ranged combat fireballs or drain your opponent\u2019s health and raise yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magick \u2013</strong> Use a variety of spells and abilities for combat and survival.\u00a0 Shadow Sprint to move around at high speeds, use your natural Night Vision when it\u2019s dark, Use Invisibility for stealth, Heal your wounds with a divine spell, Always know where your enemies are by seeing their Aura, Suck the life from your enemies and give it to yourself and hurl explosive fireballs at your opponents from a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive \u2013</strong> Manage your health by keeping fed and consume blood and plasma to keep your magic charged.\u00a0 Decide at night how you will avoid the Tormented Souls that hunt you and are nearly impossible to kill.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot \u2013</strong> Slay your enemies and grab what is in their loot bags.\u00a0 Find and Explore Demonic Ruins and Devil Fortresses and crack open their hidden Treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make Friends \u2013</strong> Tame Demonic Beasts like the Hellhound with the right offering in your hand and have them fight by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farm or Hunt \u2013</strong>\u00a0 Hunt Beasts like the Hellgoat, Hellhound or the Chunky &amp; Tasty looking SHoo-MaN Demon for meat and hearts or plant Plasma Fruit seeds at home and grow your own infinite supply of sustenance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock Achievements \u2013</strong> Inspect in-game Statistics for keeping record of what you have done and Unlock Achievements as you progress through your adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2490850?t=1748944543","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748944543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490850/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748944543","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/249085