er a variety of Demons and Devils and engage in intense melee hack and slash combat or use magic for ranged combat fireballs or drain your opponent\u2019s health and raise yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magick \u2013</strong> Use a variety of spells and abilities for combat and survival.\u00a0 Shadow Sprint to move around at high speeds, use your natural Night Vision when it\u2019s dark, Use Invisibility for stealth, Heal your wounds with a divine spell, Always know where your enemies are by seeing their Aura, Suck the life from your enemies and give it to yourself and hurl explosive fireballs at your opponents from a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive \u2013</strong> Manage your health by keeping fed and consume blood and plasma to keep your magic charged.\u00a0 Decide at night how you will avoid the Tormented Souls that hunt you and are nearly impossible to kill.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot \u2013</strong> Slay your enemies and grab what is in their loot bags.\u00a0 Find and Explore Demonic Ruins and Devil Fortresses and crack open their hidden Treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make Friends \u2013</strong> Tame Demonic Beasts like the Hellhound with the right offering in your hand and have them fight by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farm or Hunt \u2013</strong>\u00a0 Hunt Beasts like the Hellgoat, Hellhound or the Chunky &amp; Tasty looking SHoo-MaN Demon for meat and hearts or plant Plasma Fruit seeds at home and grow your own infinite supply of sustenance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock Achievements \u2013</strong> Inspect in-game Statistics for keeping record of what you have done and Unlock Achievements as you progress through your adventure.</p>","dev